      "y": 4992,
      "props": {
        "w": 640,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Ideal elastic members only. Fixed–guided: end rotations restrained, relative translation free.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "ec3-sheet-4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec3_193",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 5024,
      "props": {
        "w": 640,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Actual K depends on frame sway, connection stiffness and intermediate restraints.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "ec3-sheet-4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec3_194",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 5064,
      "props": {
        "w": 640,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Complex frames may require a separate stability analysis. Viewing this annex never changes Ky/Kz.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "ec3-sheet-4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec3_195",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 5104,
      "props": {
        "w": 640,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "LTB k / kw are lateral-bending / warping boundary factors, separate from flexural Ky / Kz.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "ec3-sheet-4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec3_196",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 5184,
      "props": {
        "w": 640,
        "h": 28,
        "html": "TECHNICAL SCOPE / NOT VERIFIED",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 15,
        "color": "#1e3a5f",
        "align": "left",
        "heading": 2
      },
      "printGroupId": "ec3-sheet-4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ec3_197",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 76,
      "y": 5224,
      "props": {
        "w": 640,
        "h": 24,
        "html": "Class 4, shear buckling, biaxial shear, arbitrary LTB and Annex A require separate verification.",
        "fontFamily": "Inter",
        "fontSize": 12,
        "color": "#475569",
        "align": "left"
      },
      "printGroupId": "ec3-sheet-4"
    },
    {
